# Innocent Blood against an indestructible creature: sacrifice is not destruction (CR 701.21a, 702.12b), so Bot2's
# Iron-Shield Elf, made indestructible in response by discarding a card, is Bot2's only creature and is sacrificed anyway.
# Bot1's Ornithopter is sacrificed too.

